OL,3,GNEWSALibrary visited 100,000 times
OL,4,Aafter summer move
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town's central library has been
OL,7,Fvisited 100,000 times since it moved to
OL,8,Fa new base in the summer, a council
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FReading Central Library opened at the
OL,12,Ftown's Civic Centre in Bridge Street in
OL,13,FJune following a move from its former
OL,14,Fspot in Kings Road after 41 years.
OL,16,FReading Borough Council said 2,700 new
OL,17,Fmembers have joined since and that
OL,18,Fabout 42,000 books have been borrowed.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
